Discover dependencies referenced by the exported roc::rocwmma target.

Related upstream fix: https://github.com/ROCm/rocm-libraries/pull/12674
Adapt the dependency-discovery fix to ROCm 7.2.4, which only uses
FindOpenMP's OpenMP::OpenMP_CXX target. The newer upstream config-mode
OpenMP::omp branch is not present in this release. Discover OpenMP before
HIP, as in upstream, to avoid PACKAGE_PREFIX_DIR changes on older CMake.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -202,6 +202,9 @@
 rocm_export_targets(
   TARGETS roc::rocwmma
   NAMESPACE roc::
+  DEPENDS
+    PACKAGE OpenMP MODULE COMPONENTS CXX
+    PACKAGE hip
 )
 
 rocm_create_package(
